        <tr><td>Ball support</td><td>Free between seats</td><td>Fixed shaft (trunnion) top and bottom</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Seal mechanism</td><td>Line pressure pushes ball into downstream seat</td><td>Seat loading controlled by springs / design</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Torque vs pressure</td><td>Torque rises with pressure class</td><td>Torque relatively stable across pressure classes</td></tr>
